{"id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-quantum-gate.md","title":"Quantum Gate","display":"df-quantum-gate — Quantum Gate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-quantum-gate","aliases":["28-df-quantum-gate","Quantum Gate"],"display":"df-quantum-gate — Quantum Gate","depends_on":["[[28-df-quantum-state]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 10.6 and 10.8; §10.3.8","source_printed_pages":"210–213,216","source_pdf_pages":"236–239,242","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-quantum-gate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-quantum-gate</span><span>Quantum Gate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-gate — Quantum Gate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 10.6 and 10.8; §10.3.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"210–213,216"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"236–239,242"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_q,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)\">\\(\\mathcal H_q,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|abc\\rangle\">\\(|abc\\rangle\\)</span> 等为计算基，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 为模二加法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_3\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_3)\">\\(T_3\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_3)\\)</span> 是下式计算基映射的唯一线性延拓。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QGate}_q\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_q):U^\\dagger U=UU^\\dagger=I_{2^q}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{QGate}_q\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_q):U^\\dagger U=UU^\\dagger=I_{2^q}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_U:\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)\\to\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q),\\qquad \\mathcal U_U(\\rho)\\coloneqq U\\rho U^\\dagger\\quad(U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U_U:\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)\\to\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q),\\qquad \\mathcal U_U(\\rho)\\coloneqq U\\rho U^\\dagger\\quad(U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H\\coloneqq2^{-1/2}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad S\\coloneqq\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;i\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad T_3|abc\\rangle\\coloneqq|ab(c\\oplus ab)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H\\coloneqq2^{-1/2}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad S\\coloneqq\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;i\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad T_3|abc\\rangle\\coloneqq|ab(c\\oplus ab)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\\{(1,H),(1,S),(3,T_3)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\\{(1,H),(1,S),(3,T_3)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>选择书中 §10.3.8 的 Hadamard、phase-shift、Toffoli 有限门库，门标签连同元数一起编码，避免将任意不可计算复振幅作为有限输入。幺正共轭保持正性和迹。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definitions 10.6 and 10.8; §10.3.8，印刷页 210–213,216；PDF 页 236–239,242。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathcal H_q,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_q,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)","display":false},{"tex":"|abc\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"T_3\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{QGate}_q\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_q):U^\\dagger U=UU^\\dagger=I_{2^q}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_U:\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q)\\to\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_q),\\qquad \\mathcal U_U(\\rho)\\coloneqq U\\rho U^\\dagger\\quad(U\\in\\mathbf{QGate}_q).","display":true},{"tex":"H\\coloneqq2^{-1/2}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad S\\coloneqq\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\0&i\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad T_3|abc\\rangle\\coloneqq|ab(c\\oplus ab)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\\{(1,H),(1,S),(3,T_3)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1747,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G$、$\\mathbf{QGate}_q$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]；$\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型：[[28-df-quantum-gate]]、[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]。"},{"id":"61f5856a7806f879","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QGate}_2$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]，$|0\\rangle$ 为辅助空白态。"}],"outgoing":["b69949a89b41b967"]}